  <item>
    <title>“与父母相处，怎么就这么难？”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b41c24772ac2295b10f43f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b41c24772ac2295b10f43f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 14:18:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 春节假期，你与父母的相处怎么样呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 我们谈论原生家庭，是为了有一天不再被它扰动。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 大多数人与父母的关系状态：靠近你，我痛苦，离开你，我更痛苦。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>我爱你，却不想靠近你。你是危险的。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我恨你，却无法离开你。因为这唤起我被抛弃的恐惧。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 为什么面对父母，我们会有“靠近你，我痛苦，离开你，我更痛苦”的心理状态呢？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 我们在早期养育关系中，经历摧毁后创造的过程。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 如果养育者无法在被【摧毁】中存活，靠近痛苦、远离更痛苦的状态就出现。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 如果养育者在【摧毁】中稳稳存活下来，婴儿就创造了一个可靠、可亲的“元客体”留存心中。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 两个办法，让我们走出这种进退两难的心理困境。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 看见父母真实的样子，从而接受真实的自己。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a> 去安全稳定的关系中获得矫正性体验。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>祝我们有勇气从原生家庭转身，去专注和经营自己的人生。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我是心理咨询师一只菌。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我擅长处理的心理议题是</span><strong><span>自我探索、女性成长、原生家庭关系中的困扰</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你愿意信任我，可</span><strong><span>扫码添加好友，和我建立咨访关系</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-LSKSv7FSVD1BbHYbpfcbg_Ar2.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/684c498ae76499dbba431244/ljIhAlo3-TE9ho_WRLqBHZeZZuzr.m4a" length="21028276" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:39</itunes:duration>
