    <guid isPermaLink="false">694c069fd292ff54b174a003</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 如何理解“爱的本质是被看见”这句话？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 三个选项，哪一个人是真正被看见、理解和接纳的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a> </span><strong><span>被完全接纳，它的发展可以拆分三层来理解。</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 第一层是看见一个人的外在表现。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a> 第二层是理解ta的表达背后的意图。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 第三层是理解并接纳ta的深层需要。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">12:19</a> 被完全接纳的体验，总结起来是这样的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 被完全接纳的关系，需要这样的前提。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 用演员陈数的话来结尾：</span><strong><span>我允许你做你，也请允许我做我自己，但是我们要彼此走近。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我是心理咨询师一只菌。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我擅长处理的心理议题是自我探索、女性成长、原生家庭关系中的困扰。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你愿意信任我，可扫码添加好友，和我建立咨访关系。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-LSKSv7FSVD1BbHYbpfcbg_Ar2.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
