  <item>
    <title>王将英雌：成长从与妈妈“分离”那一刻启动</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690e1dd2af4fc00da7a94723</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690e1dd2af4fc00da7a94723</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Nov 2025 16:29:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 我认为《miss king/王将英雌》向东亚女孩提出了两个问题：</span></p><span></span><p><span>①如果女性不主动投子认输，会发生什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>②被困在原生家庭的东亚女孩，ta所面临的成长困境到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 对女主飞鸟的原生家庭进行分析。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> 摇摇欲坠的家庭结构是如何形成的？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a> “丧偶式育儿”的真正“危害”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">05:46</a> 一个不快乐的妈妈对小孩成长的影响是什么？</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 30岁的飞鸟，开始为自己而活。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 飞鸟的将棋才能从哪里来？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a> 飞鸟与妈妈形成融合共生关系。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> 原生家庭对成长的阻碍到底是什么？</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">20:12</a> 飞鸟如何踏上破局之路？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 心理层面与父母分离。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a> 遇到了真正的“父母”。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 创造与他人的关系。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> </span><strong><span>无论是看似有多么不堪的人，只要拥有让你感到自己被信任、被支持、被鼓励的关系，就一定可以向着自己想要的方向去生长。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 妈妈们，去大胆成为“鲜活”的人，孩子自然会跟上。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是用心理咨询帮生活兜底的咨询师一只菌。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我擅长处理的心理议题是自我探索、女性成长、原生家庭关系中的困扰。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你愿意信任我，可扫码添加好友，和我建立咨访关系。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-LSKSv7FSVD1BbHYbpfcbg_Ar2.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
